        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Some of My Favorite Foods</h1>\n    \n    <h2>Tacos</h2>\n    <img src=\"tacos.jpg\" alt=\"A plate of tacos\">\n    <p>Crispy or soft, tacos are great with just about any filling.</p>\n    \n    <h2>Ramen</h2>\n    <img src=\"ramen.jpg\" alt=\"A bowl of ramen with noodles and broth\">\n    <p>A warm bowl of ramen is the perfect comfort food on a cold day.</p>\n    \n    <h2>Jollof Rice</h2>\n    <img src=\"jollof_rice.jpg\" alt=\"A large bowl of jollof rice\">\n    <p>A flavorful West African rice dish cooked in a rich tomato sauce.</p>\n\n    <p>Image credits: all images from Wikimedia Commons</p>\n    \n  </body>\n</html>",
